WEBVTT

01:38.250 --> 01:41.060
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.110 --> 01:43.960
[Episode 12]

01:46.870 --> 01:48.229
The mountain is particularly quiet

01:48.590 --> 01:49.680
at night.

01:50.759 --> 01:52.450
There isn't even a dog barking.

01:54.000 --> 01:55.060
The mountain is a place

01:55.229 --> 01:56.120
of serenity.

01:57.560 --> 01:58.640
I don't like quietness.

01:59.430 --> 02:00.510
I enjoy hustle and bustle.

02:01.070 --> 02:02.280
The more people around, the better.

02:03.990 --> 02:05.940
Since I became able to see demons,

02:06.680 --> 02:08.360
I've always hated being alone.

02:09.840 --> 02:11.610
There's a constant panic in my heart.

02:12.870 --> 02:14.710
Even mirrors can turn into demons.

02:15.770 --> 02:16.930
Doesn't it mean benches and chairs

02:16.950 --> 02:18.510
can also become demons?

02:19.150 --> 02:20.680
Demons are not that commonly seen.

02:21.120 --> 02:22.230
Don't you worry about that.

02:25.560 --> 02:26.590
You don't understand.

02:27.120 --> 02:28.360
You have no fear at all.

02:29.070 --> 02:30.310
Demon hunters are still humans.

02:30.840 --> 02:32.000
We have our fears.

02:32.910 --> 02:34.000
Even my father

02:34.310 --> 02:35.640
would sometimes get scared.

02:36.630 --> 02:37.360
Otherwise,

02:37.960 --> 02:39.360
why would he learn that spell?

02:41.490 --> 02:42.770
Do you have fears?

02:46.670 --> 02:48.190
I was afraid of nothing

02:48.480 --> 02:49.550
when I was 13 or 14 years old.

02:50.630 --> 02:52.680
I felt like I was omnipotent.

02:53.430 --> 02:54.190
One day,

02:54.590 --> 02:56.030
a tiger came from outside the city.

02:56.870 --> 02:57.470
That tiger

02:57.470 --> 02:58.590
caused many casualties.

02:59.240 --> 03:00.190
I begged my father

03:01.000 --> 03:02.110
to take me with him

03:02.400 --> 03:03.800
and eliminate that tiger together.

03:06.000 --> 03:07.080
Did you kill it?

03:07.840 --> 03:08.630
No, we didn't.

03:09.870 --> 03:10.750
That tiger was maimed

03:10.880 --> 03:12.560
after being shot by me and my father.

03:13.000 --> 03:13.960
It fled to a cave.

03:14.910 --> 03:16.000
We followed it all the way,

03:16.430 --> 03:18.760
and finally found that two tiger cubs

03:18.790 --> 03:19.670
were waiting for it in the cave.

03:21.070 --> 03:22.030
My father's heart was softened.

03:22.310 --> 03:23.430
He then let the tiger go.

03:24.540 --> 03:26.910
At that time, I was disappointed

03:27.280 --> 03:28.070
and upset.

03:28.980 --> 03:30.020
I thought

03:30.370 --> 03:31.680
I could get a tiger skin.

03:37.400 --> 03:38.280
What are you laughing at?

03:39.960 --> 03:40.910
I'm not laughing.

03:41.910 --> 03:43.030
Go on with your story.

03:46.710 --> 03:48.280
A few years after that,

03:49.070 --> 03:50.030
I realized that my father

03:50.030 --> 03:50.960
didn't really go out

03:51.240 --> 03:52.390
to practice medicine.

03:52.800 --> 03:53.800
He was out catching demons.

03:54.560 --> 03:55.710
In most cases,

03:55.840 --> 03:57.280
he would return after two or three days.

03:58.210 --> 03:59.130
But one time,

03:59.430 --> 04:00.680
he was gone for half a year.

04:01.150 --> 04:02.400
There was no news about him at all.

04:02.910 --> 04:04.080
When he came home,

04:04.710 --> 04:05.910
he was seriously injured.

04:08.800 --> 04:10.400
That's when I understood

04:10.950 --> 04:11.950
what fear truly was.

04:13.150 --> 04:14.630
That's also when I realized

04:16.269 --> 04:17.269
why my father

04:18.040 --> 04:18.800
let go

04:18.829 --> 04:19.800
of that tiger.

04:21.750 --> 04:22.360
Anyway,

04:23.270 --> 04:23.950
it's water under the bridge now.

04:25.190 --> 04:27.240
Now, I'm poor

04:27.560 --> 04:28.430
and  all alone.

04:29.630 --> 04:30.880
I'm close to no one,

04:31.510 --> 04:32.870
so I don't have any fear.

04:33.600 --> 04:34.390
You're talking nonsense.

04:35.110 --> 04:36.420
You're not poor

04:36.450 --> 04:37.420
and all alone.

04:38.120 --> 04:39.800
You have Ganshan Clinic. Chi Xue,

04:39.920 --> 04:40.830
Wen Jian and I

04:45.190 --> 04:46.190
are all by your side.

04:59.560 --> 05:00.120
Xuanye,

05:00.140 --> 05:00.920
feel my hand.

05:03.830 --> 05:04.600
Touch it now.

05:07.430 --> 05:08.070
Come on.

05:17.450 --> 05:18.890
My palm is especially warm, isn't it?

05:21.360 --> 05:23.000
It's because of the pattern you drew on it.

05:24.390 --> 05:26.120
Every time I get scared,

05:26.310 --> 05:27.630
it gives out heat.

05:30.510 --> 05:31.160
Why don't you

05:31.950 --> 05:33.430
draw one on your palm too?

05:35.820 --> 05:37.260
I don't need such a thing.

05:38.190 --> 05:39.120
Fine.

05:39.950 --> 05:40.430
You're right.

05:40.740 --> 05:41.909
Mine was drawn by you.

05:42.600 --> 05:44.630
Physician Jiu is a miracle maker.

05:45.060 --> 05:46.510
Ordinary people like us

05:46.610 --> 05:47.810
are indebted to you for your protection.

05:48.240 --> 05:49.430
I have to say thank you.

05:51.120 --> 05:52.360
So how do you plan to thank me?

05:52.830 --> 05:54.120
What do you want me to do?

05:56.070 --> 05:57.680
Just be a good girl and sleep now.

05:59.310 --> 06:00.040
You're just

06:00.070 --> 06:01.160
tired of talking to me.

06:03.630 --> 06:04.680
So you've noticed.

06:05.750 --> 06:06.680
I'm a bit tired of it.

06:11.580 --> 06:12.870
Neither do I want to speak to you now.

06:27.750 --> 06:28.630
Why are you so quiet?

06:30.070 --> 06:30.830
I'm asleep.

06:32.510 --> 06:33.480
Yet you responded to me. How come?

06:34.830 --> 06:36.140
I'm about to fall asleep.

08:02.680 --> 08:03.920
Very impressive.

08:15.510 --> 08:16.450
[Reunion Inn]

08:29.270 --> 08:31.000
Did you use to be a soldier?

08:32.870 --> 08:34.360
How did you figure that out?

08:35.890 --> 08:37.120
The skills you just showed

08:37.270 --> 08:38.900
look like what the military would teach.

08:39.299 --> 08:41.230
Your armor is of high quality,

08:41.539 --> 08:42.809
unlike that made by civilians.

08:44.380 --> 08:45.430
Some features on it

08:45.760 --> 08:47.160
tell me that it was made long ago.

08:49.150 --> 08:49.950
Can't it be

08:50.360 --> 08:51.480
something I borrowed

08:51.510 --> 08:52.490
out of vanity?

08:54.120 --> 08:55.550
You could borrow the armor,

08:56.040 --> 08:57.350
but your skills have given away the truth.

08:58.330 --> 08:59.840
You're very skilled at using that broadsword.

09:00.350 --> 09:01.440
You couldn't have made this

09:01.720 --> 09:02.360
achievement

09:02.390 --> 09:03.510
without 10 to 20 years of practice.

09:07.030 --> 09:07.750
You're perceptive.

09:08.960 --> 09:09.480
This way, please.

09:14.550 --> 09:15.550
Does it taste bad?

09:17.080 --> 09:17.910
No.

09:18.480 --> 09:19.200
It's okay.

09:20.260 --> 09:21.710
I knew it wouldn't taste good.

09:22.240 --> 09:23.380
My sense of taste doesn't work,

09:24.200 --> 09:26.120
so I can't make delicious food.

09:27.360 --> 09:28.840
Your sense of taste doesn't work?

09:31.240 --> 09:32.120
Why is that?

09:33.390 --> 09:34.080
I don't know.

09:34.620 --> 09:35.860
I've been like this since I was little.

09:38.840 --> 09:39.500
Banxia,

09:40.080 --> 09:41.210
put it down.

09:41.500 --> 09:42.900
I'll ask my father

09:42.920 --> 09:44.440
to fix a new bowl for you.

09:45.240 --> 09:45.810
It's fine.

09:46.560 --> 09:47.990
The flavor is a bit strong,

09:48.240 --> 09:49.440
but it's not entirely unacceptable.

09:51.670 --> 09:53.880
When you cook next time,

09:54.170 --> 09:55.670
try using less ingredients

09:55.790 --> 09:57.340
and adding more water.

09:57.720 --> 09:58.750
Then it'll be fine.

10:00.830 --> 10:02.800
Someone else said the same to me before.

10:03.240 --> 10:05.790
But when I cook,

10:06.320 --> 10:07.150
I just can't help

10:07.170 --> 10:08.390
but to put in many ingredients.

10:09.450 --> 10:10.090
Maybe because

10:10.110 --> 10:11.710
I can't taste anything,

10:13.150 --> 10:15.080
I feel the need to make the food look pretty.

10:17.630 --> 10:19.760
The country has been at peace for over 10 years.

10:19.790 --> 10:20.770
Wars rarely happen.

10:21.640 --> 10:22.760
Sir, where were you

10:22.790 --> 10:23.870
recruited as a soldier?

10:24.030 --> 10:24.670
Well,

10:28.030 --> 10:29.270
I joined the army at 16.

10:29.910 --> 10:31.960
It was more than 30 years ago.

10:33.290 --> 10:34.270
Back then,

10:34.600 --> 10:35.360
there were droughts.

10:35.630 --> 10:38.360
Dead people outnumbered the living ones.

10:41.850 --> 10:42.610
To make sure

10:44.080 --> 10:45.290
I could survive,

10:46.120 --> 10:47.430
my parents had me join the army.

10:49.720 --> 10:50.440
At first,

10:51.440 --> 10:52.580
I spent three years in the north

10:53.360 --> 10:54.000
transferring grain.

10:55.000 --> 10:55.760
Later on,

10:57.480 --> 10:59.370
I went to the south with the troops.

11:00.410 --> 11:01.290
That was when

11:02.340 --> 11:04.890
I started working for General Zhang Guang.

11:07.320 --> 11:09.630
General Zhang is said to be very strict with his troops.

11:10.600 --> 11:12.290
All his soldiers

11:12.310 --> 11:13.510
are brave and tough.

11:14.640 --> 11:16.120
The fact that you were chosen to work for him

11:16.670 --> 11:18.630
means you were a perfect warrior.

11:19.000 --> 11:20.750
I wouldn't say that.

11:22.750 --> 11:24.980
I just followed the orders,

11:26.440 --> 11:27.720
and never broke the rules.

11:28.850 --> 11:30.420
That wasn't easy.

11:32.080 --> 11:33.390
In fact, I didn't spend

11:34.600 --> 11:36.150
much time in the south.

11:37.150 --> 11:38.510
I was soon relocated

11:38.910 --> 11:41.070
to Guima Fort.

11:41.720 --> 11:44.770
[Guima Fort]

11:42.240 --> 11:43.870
Sand storms frequently happen there.

11:44.000 --> 11:44.910
It is an isolated place.

11:45.440 --> 11:46.390
The soldiers stationed there

11:46.910 --> 11:48.550
would be replaced every five years.

11:49.360 --> 11:50.930
Those who finished their terms

11:49.980 --> 11:51.830
[Junior Squad Leader]
[Hua Yingran]

11:50.950 --> 11:52.820
could go home with handsome rewards.

11:52.910 --> 11:53.980
And what?

11:54.960 --> 11:55.870
Well,

11:56.550 --> 11:57.910
we led a plain life.

11:58.600 --> 11:59.530
One could hardly

12:00.090 --> 12:02.210
see any visitors there in a year.

12:02.440 --> 12:04.030
What could we have done?

12:04.910 --> 12:06.760
Our lives were all about grazing

12:06.850 --> 12:07.860
and farming.

12:08.790 --> 12:11.000
Finally, five years passed, and we were supposed

12:11.030 --> 12:12.080
to be relieved.

12:12.630 --> 12:13.480
But no one came

12:13.900 --> 12:15.620
to replace us.

12:16.750 --> 12:17.720
Six months after that,

12:18.510 --> 12:19.960
the chief brought two attendants with him

12:20.560 --> 12:22.110
and set out for the imperial court to seek an answer.

12:22.630 --> 12:24.480
But we never heard from them

12:26.600 --> 12:28.550
after that day.

12:29.440 --> 12:30.610
Some time later,

12:31.000 --> 12:32.440
a few merchants happened to pass by.

12:33.240 --> 12:34.750
They told us

12:35.150 --> 12:35.670
that

12:36.430 --> 12:38.000
the then emperor had died.

12:39.080 --> 12:41.450
The princes were fighting each other

12:41.480 --> 12:42.870
for the throne.

12:44.910 --> 12:45.510
As for us...

12:46.150 --> 12:48.360
We were in the far west.

12:49.360 --> 12:50.910
Under those circumstances,

12:52.200 --> 12:54.150
we were probably neglected.

12:56.360 --> 12:57.440
What did you do then?

12:58.740 --> 12:59.670
What could we do?

13:01.990 --> 13:03.120
Our days

13:04.120 --> 13:05.600
became harder and harder.

13:06.240 --> 13:08.990
Soon, some soldiers tried to flee.

13:09.200 --> 13:10.570
The first few deserters

13:10.600 --> 13:12.840
were caught by the junior squad leader Hua Yingran

13:12.880 --> 13:14.050
and whipped.

13:14.240 --> 13:15.550
But that was useless.

13:15.960 --> 13:17.710
Other soldiers still wanted to leave.

13:18.310 --> 13:19.220
It is a capital crime

13:19.840 --> 13:21.720
for border guards to leave their posts!

13:22.320 --> 13:24.240
Whether we're alive or dead,

13:24.750 --> 13:26.600
we must stay on our jobs!

13:27.440 --> 13:29.030
But how many soldiers

13:29.510 --> 13:31.150
could he stop on his own?

13:31.480 --> 13:32.930
They all wanted to leave.

13:32.960 --> 13:34.320
He couldn't force them to stay.

13:35.340 --> 13:35.890
What about you?

13:36.750 --> 13:37.390
Did you leave as well?

13:38.320 --> 13:39.000
Don't even get me started.

13:39.030 --> 13:40.390
I did plan to go away.

13:40.600 --> 13:42.080
I already packed up my stuff.

13:42.670 --> 13:43.870
But later on, I knew I couldn't go.

13:45.600 --> 13:46.360
Why not?

13:47.640 --> 13:49.350
The junior squad leader fell ill.

13:49.370 --> 13:50.300
Once I left,

13:50.790 --> 13:51.630
he would die.

13:52.960 --> 13:53.560
You, you, you...

13:53.960 --> 13:55.180
Why don't you stay in bed?

13:55.390 --> 13:56.770
W-Why do you have to get up?

13:57.550 --> 13:58.720
Just take the medicine before you...

13:59.200 --> 14:00.120
Don't mind me.

14:00.670 --> 14:01.960
My days are numbered.

14:02.320 --> 14:03.120
What's that nonsense about?

14:03.270 --> 14:04.210
Take the medicine now.

14:04.240 --> 14:04.840
Okay?

14:05.550 --> 14:06.960
I know

14:07.630 --> 14:09.750
I'm dying.

14:11.750 --> 14:12.630
Yingran, you...

14:13.080 --> 14:13.670
Where's the flag?

14:14.160 --> 14:14.840
Where's my flag?

14:14.870 --> 14:15.750
I hung it up.

14:16.440 --> 14:17.390
I hung it up for you.

14:17.910 --> 14:18.480
Don't worry.

14:23.750 --> 14:26.790
You and I are border guards.

14:27.960 --> 14:31.390
We're the last living souls in the fortress.

14:31.750 --> 14:32.360
Yes!

14:34.600 --> 14:37.120
The flag must stay up!

14:38.080 --> 14:39.120
The flag must stay up!

14:41.200 --> 14:42.080
Unfortunately,

14:42.510 --> 14:44.100
though I took care of him for six months,

14:44.130 --> 14:45.940
he still passed away.

14:46.630 --> 14:48.080
I stayed there for over 20 years

14:48.750 --> 14:50.550
just to honor my promise.

14:53.510 --> 14:54.630
Then, a royal envoy

14:54.650 --> 14:55.650
passed by the fort

14:55.750 --> 14:56.910
and reported this matter

14:57.720 --> 14:58.960
to the imperial court,

14:59.790 --> 15:01.790
which later assigned an official to take over that place.

15:02.550 --> 15:03.320
As for me,

15:05.910 --> 15:07.120
I came back home.

15:08.600 --> 15:10.250
You guarded the borders alone for two decades.

15:11.240 --> 15:11.960
Sir,

15:12.990 --> 15:14.030
you're a true hero.

15:16.750 --> 15:19.480
A true hero must be smart,

15:19.910 --> 15:22.830
courageous and strong.

15:23.200 --> 15:24.440
In what way

15:25.320 --> 15:27.270
am I qualified to be a hero?

15:27.790 --> 15:29.630
Those who devote themselves

15:30.280 --> 15:32.280
to the country and the people are also heroes.

15:32.910 --> 15:34.000
Brave individuals

15:34.290 --> 15:36.050
may not be as great as real patriots, right?

15:36.080 --> 15:37.600
Patriots?

15:38.220 --> 15:39.380
I was just trying

15:39.410 --> 15:40.920
to do my job well.

15:41.360 --> 15:43.210
Exactly because people like you

15:43.240 --> 15:43.930
choose to do

15:43.960 --> 15:45.200
their jobs right,

15:45.480 --> 15:46.720
the country and the people are secured.

15:49.600 --> 15:50.790
Young man,

15:51.670 --> 15:53.120
you talk the talk,

15:53.440 --> 15:55.240
but why don't you walk the walk?

15:56.480 --> 15:59.630
You're always wandering around in the mountain.

16:01.960 --> 16:02.910
How do you know

16:02.930 --> 16:04.720
I'm idling about

16:04.910 --> 16:05.960
and killing time

16:06.440 --> 16:07.910
instead of working hard?

16:11.910 --> 16:13.360
You were away for years,

16:13.650 --> 16:14.760
and you know a lot of things.

16:15.740 --> 16:17.020
Actually, I have a question.

16:18.750 --> 16:19.910
Have you ever

16:20.590 --> 16:21.630
seen a demon?

16:28.080 --> 16:28.670
Wuniang,

16:28.840 --> 16:30.480
a pillow is missing.

16:47.390 --> 16:48.000
Banxia,

16:48.600 --> 16:50.910
are you not getting along with your husband?

16:53.200 --> 16:55.240
Did you sleep alone last night?

16:58.600 --> 17:00.030
You two, as a young couple,

17:00.720 --> 17:01.960
spent a night in this secluded mountain.

17:03.120 --> 17:05.349
Why didn't you sleep together?

17:10.720 --> 17:13.349
I caught a cold last night, didn't I?

17:14.099 --> 17:15.300
I just didn't want to infect him.

17:16.160 --> 17:17.960
Don't lie to me.

17:19.000 --> 17:20.550
I work in the inn,

17:21.000 --> 17:23.109
and I've received

17:23.480 --> 17:24.550
many couples

17:25.069 --> 17:26.829
who have divided opinions.

17:28.960 --> 17:30.280
It just didn't occur to me

17:31.110 --> 17:33.160
that even a young and beautiful wife like you

17:33.720 --> 17:35.880
would be resented by the husband.

17:37.510 --> 17:38.480
People's lives

17:39.440 --> 17:40.590
are so complicated.

17:43.920 --> 17:44.680
Wuniang,

17:46.200 --> 17:48.240
what kind of person do you wish to become?

17:51.000 --> 17:51.920
I haven't thought about it.

17:53.720 --> 17:55.000
But now, I feel like

17:55.510 --> 17:56.640
it's a good thing to become

17:57.200 --> 17:57.960
someone like you.

17:59.790 --> 18:01.440
Everyone's experiences are different.

18:02.070 --> 18:02.750
How can anyone

18:02.750 --> 18:04.070
just copy another person's life?

18:05.030 --> 18:06.030
In my opinion,

18:06.270 --> 18:07.160
it's nice that you can

18:07.160 --> 18:08.830
run an inn with your father.

18:09.920 --> 18:11.000
You meet different people,

18:11.440 --> 18:12.440
and you have various experiences.

18:13.000 --> 18:14.180
Meet different people...

18:14.720 --> 18:15.960
Have various experiences...

18:20.510 --> 18:21.200
Wuniang,

18:22.440 --> 18:24.110
how long have you been

18:24.400 --> 18:25.160
running this inn?

18:26.880 --> 18:27.910
For a long time.

18:28.640 --> 18:30.030
More than 10 years, I'd say.

18:30.470 --> 18:31.960
More than 10 years...

18:33.400 --> 18:34.680
Look,

18:34.920 --> 18:36.160
your inn

18:36.240 --> 18:37.640
is located in the wilderness

18:38.480 --> 18:40.000
and is far from the government office.

18:42.160 --> 18:43.750
Has anything dangerous

18:44.400 --> 18:45.440
ever happened here?

18:45.950 --> 18:47.140
My father told me

18:48.780 --> 18:50.380
that as long as I stayed in the inn,

18:50.790 --> 18:52.160
I would be safe.

18:55.650 --> 18:57.190
My father also told me

18:57.750 --> 18:59.790
that the outside world was very dangerous,

19:00.830 --> 19:02.590
and it could cost me my life.

19:03.880 --> 19:04.550
The outside world...

19:06.510 --> 19:07.240
You look

19:07.240 --> 19:08.550
educated and well-mannered.

19:09.200 --> 19:10.350
Why would you believe demons exist?

19:12.160 --> 19:13.100
To be honest,

19:13.400 --> 19:14.400
I firmly believe they do exist.

19:15.580 --> 19:17.380
The world is full of wonders.

19:18.170 --> 19:18.750
Perhaps,

19:18.780 --> 19:20.300
there is a demon in your inn.

19:20.960 --> 19:21.790
Isn't it possible?

19:22.110 --> 19:24.070
I've been running this inn for many years,

19:24.510 --> 19:25.960
Never have I heard

19:26.120 --> 19:27.270
that there are demons.

19:27.710 --> 19:29.070
Would you let me do a test then?

19:30.330 --> 19:31.200
How?

19:46.590 --> 19:47.270
What is this?

19:47.550 --> 19:48.680
What it is doesn't matter.

19:49.370 --> 19:50.170
The important thing is,

19:50.960 --> 19:52.000
it detects demons.

19:59.960 --> 20:02.160
W-What is it about the outside world that is dangerous?

20:02.350 --> 20:03.620
Wild cats.

20:04.830 --> 20:07.440
Every year, many people here

20:07.920 --> 20:09.550
would be killed by wild cats.

20:11.790 --> 20:13.240
Wuniang, do you mean cats?

20:14.060 --> 20:14.950
The wild cats here

20:15.480 --> 20:16.110
are big

20:16.510 --> 20:17.160
and fierce.

20:17.640 --> 20:19.610
When they act in packs,

20:20.270 --> 20:21.510
they can fight like wolves.

20:22.200 --> 20:24.350
If you run into those wild cats,

20:25.030 --> 20:26.550
I'm afraid you won't be

20:27.310 --> 20:28.550
able to fight them off.

20:29.000 --> 20:30.260
In that case,

20:30.640 --> 20:32.000
aren't you scared

20:32.660 --> 20:33.900
of those dangerous wild cats

20:34.440 --> 20:35.240
since you're running an inn here?

20:35.790 --> 20:36.640
Not at all.

20:37.680 --> 20:38.510
Why?

20:39.020 --> 20:40.300
Because no wild cats

20:40.330 --> 20:41.600
dare to enter our inn.

20:52.120 --> 20:52.920
Seriously?

21:00.100 --> 21:00.880
Let's have some tea.

21:05.000 --> 21:06.240
What makes you so sure of that?

21:07.070 --> 21:08.200
Even the fiercest beasts

21:08.400 --> 21:09.580
are afraid of humans.

21:10.070 --> 21:11.210
There are many people

21:11.230 --> 21:12.510
in our inn,

21:12.840 --> 21:14.430
so the wild cats wouldn't dare to come in.

21:33.400 --> 21:34.550
Chief Constable Chu?

21:35.440 --> 21:37.160
Here, would you like a turnip?

21:38.270 --> 21:39.070
Smelling good, right?

21:39.070 --> 21:40.480
Eat it. Eat it now.

21:41.550 --> 21:42.510
Help yourself.

21:45.400 --> 21:45.990
Eat this.

21:46.400 --> 21:47.310
What are you doing here?

21:48.640 --> 21:49.320
Do you remember Gao Sheng,

21:49.350 --> 21:50.590
whose horse killed a man?

21:52.400 --> 21:53.720
Chi Xue told me about him.

21:54.000 --> 21:55.000
That man was beheaded,

21:55.400 --> 21:56.440
but he didn't really die.

21:56.720 --> 21:57.240
Yes.

21:58.030 --> 21:58.880
I was ordered to catch him.

21:58.880 --> 21:59.960
I followed him all the way here.

22:01.680 --> 22:02.350
Have you caught him yet?

22:03.160 --> 22:03.830
When I found him,

22:04.550 --> 22:05.400
he was already dead.

22:06.400 --> 22:07.110
How did that happen?

22:07.720 --> 22:08.510
I discovered his corpse

22:08.510 --> 22:09.680
in the woods.

22:10.420 --> 22:11.940
His eyes had been gouged out.

22:12.240 --> 22:13.750
His hair had been cut evenly.

22:15.100 --> 22:16.820
The locals said the wild cats did it.

22:17.400 --> 22:18.720
Wild cats might take a man's eyes out.

22:18.750 --> 22:20.270
That could possibly happen.

22:20.750 --> 22:21.830
But they can't cut a man's hair

22:21.830 --> 22:23.030
off evenly, can they?

22:24.850 --> 22:26.520
Wild cats may not be able to do it,

22:27.640 --> 22:28.750
but the Cat Demon can.

22:29.420 --> 22:30.230
Cat Demon?

22:32.030 --> 22:32.750
What Cat Demon?

22:33.200 --> 22:34.740
Chi Wangchuan once told me

22:35.350 --> 22:36.110
that my father was helped by

22:36.140 --> 22:37.190
a demon that could change lives.

22:37.880 --> 22:39.450
We suspect that this demon

22:39.640 --> 22:40.810
is actually the Cat Demon Nine Lives.

22:42.030 --> 22:43.470
You were going after Gao Sheng.

22:43.680 --> 22:45.200
Why would you stay at Reunion Inn?

22:45.700 --> 22:46.800
It was too late when we were getting back to the city,

22:47.070 --> 22:48.030
so we decided to stay here.

22:48.270 --> 22:48.690
We planned

22:48.720 --> 22:49.920
to leave the next morning,

22:50.710 --> 22:52.230
but something I found held us back.

23:01.590 --> 23:02.810
This is Gao Sheng's hair band.

23:03.580 --> 23:04.380
Are you sure?

23:05.410 --> 23:06.410
That day on the street,

23:06.590 --> 23:07.750
I saw this on him.

23:08.780 --> 23:10.060
I did find it familiar.

23:10.490 --> 23:11.610
I wondered if Gao Sheng

23:11.640 --> 23:12.560
had stayed here

23:13.030 --> 23:13.900
on his journey.

23:14.540 --> 23:15.690
So I asked the innkeeper about it.

23:15.960 --> 23:16.610
Both he and his employees

23:16.640 --> 23:17.790
said they had never seen this guy.

23:18.750 --> 23:19.800
I got suspicious,

23:19.820 --> 23:20.650
so I let a fellow go

23:20.750 --> 23:21.790
to report the situation to the lord,

23:22.030 --> 23:23.240
while I stayed here with a colleague

23:23.270 --> 23:24.030
to continue our investigation.

23:25.310 --> 23:26.160
What have you found?

23:26.880 --> 23:29.030
The innkeeper's name is Feng Tian.

23:29.400 --> 23:30.910
He has a daughter named Feng Wuniang.

23:31.750 --> 23:33.550
The servants look odd.

23:33.830 --> 23:35.310
They like to peep and to imitate others.

23:35.980 --> 23:37.370
They don't seem very bright.

23:37.680 --> 23:38.480
They're always whispering

23:38.510 --> 23:39.440
behind people's backs.

23:40.750 --> 23:42.680
As for the innkeeper Feng Tian,

23:42.870 --> 23:43.950
he seems neat,

23:43.980 --> 23:45.090
and he knows martial skills.

23:47.790 --> 23:49.160
Speaking of demons,

23:49.310 --> 23:50.160
do you think

23:50.790 --> 23:52.070
he's one of them?

23:52.480 --> 23:53.720
He used to be in the military.

23:54.000 --> 23:54.680
I already ran a test.

23:55.360 --> 23:56.120
He is a human,

23:56.200 --> 23:57.110
not a demon.

23:59.070 --> 24:00.920
He used to be in the military?

24:01.960 --> 24:02.590
Yes.

24:03.230 --> 24:04.380
He's an excellent martial fighter.

24:04.960 --> 24:06.240
He is just

24:06.370 --> 24:07.740
as good as you and me,

24:08.270 --> 24:09.480
or even better.

24:16.130 --> 24:16.850
Stay!

24:23.000 --> 24:23.480
This...

24:23.790 --> 24:25.250
W-What is this about?

24:26.350 --> 24:27.480
You don't know about this?

24:28.030 --> 24:29.110
Chi Xue is...

24:29.510 --> 24:30.310
A demon?

24:32.300 --> 24:33.950
A demon hunter takes a demon with him?

24:34.720 --> 24:35.590
Does that sound strange to you?

24:46.960 --> 24:47.680
Wuniang?

25:10.070 --> 25:10.700
Wuniang.

25:13.110 --> 25:13.790
Wuniang?

25:15.830 --> 25:16.690
I'm coming in.

25:20.450 --> 25:21.120
Wuniang,

25:21.790 --> 25:23.060
the guest in Xin Court

25:23.080 --> 25:23.930
has stayed here

25:23.960 --> 25:24.680
for half a month.

25:25.020 --> 25:25.890
If you've had you fun,

25:26.080 --> 25:27.350
please just let him go.

25:30.830 --> 25:32.220
The male guest in Jia Court

25:32.550 --> 25:33.720
has talked to me.

25:34.400 --> 25:35.750
He's a demon hunter,

25:36.310 --> 25:37.240
clever and persistent.

25:37.750 --> 25:39.110
You'd better stay away from him.

25:43.750 --> 25:45.240
I'm is talking to you.

25:45.260 --> 25:46.540
Are you listening?

25:49.790 --> 25:50.720
I'm telling you,

25:51.060 --> 25:52.310
the male guest in Jia Court

25:52.340 --> 25:53.370
could get you in danger.

25:53.670 --> 25:54.560
Try not to

25:54.590 --> 25:56.510
show up when he is around.

25:57.030 --> 25:58.270
Father, didn't you tell me

25:58.890 --> 26:00.810
that I would be blessed

26:01.400 --> 26:02.580
if I acted like an upright person

26:02.720 --> 26:04.200
and did good deeds?

26:05.030 --> 26:06.730
I'm not evil.

26:06.960 --> 26:08.680
Why would they want to hurt me?

26:09.920 --> 26:11.550
Or do you think

26:11.830 --> 26:13.590
I'll affect the inn's business?

26:16.350 --> 26:18.550
We are very different from them.

26:18.620 --> 26:19.900
Staying away from them

26:20.960 --> 26:22.580
is staying away from trouble.

26:23.790 --> 26:24.720
No.

26:25.200 --> 26:27.650
I really like that female guest in Jia Court.

26:27.990 --> 26:29.100
I want to spend

26:29.120 --> 26:30.550
more time with her.

26:33.750 --> 26:34.550
Is it pretty?

26:36.730 --> 26:37.410
My dearest daughter,

26:37.440 --> 26:38.750
can you stop with this nonsense?

26:38.750 --> 26:40.000
Just listen to me, will you?

27:25.330 --> 27:27.890
[Reunion Inn]

27:36.000 --> 27:37.240
Here, have some water.

27:38.170 --> 27:39.220
I'm fine now.

27:43.240 --> 27:44.720
Is what Youhuang said true?

27:45.440 --> 27:46.790
Does the Cat Demon really kill humans?

27:48.750 --> 27:49.750
You don't think he does?

27:50.920 --> 27:52.480
I don't think he does.

27:53.830 --> 27:54.830
Clear your mind.

27:55.030 --> 27:55.830
Go to bed now.

27:56.440 --> 27:57.190
I'll be in the next room.

27:57.220 --> 27:57.980
Scream if you need help.

28:41.920 --> 28:43.070
Father, didn't you tell me

28:43.720 --> 28:45.750
that I would be blessed

28:46.160 --> 28:47.410
if I acted like an upright person

28:47.550 --> 28:49.160
and did good deeds?

28:49.880 --> 28:51.550
I'm not evil.

28:51.860 --> 28:53.660
Why would they want to hurt me?

29:12.510 --> 29:13.240
Who is it?

29:22.510 --> 29:23.270
Who is out there?

29:29.570 --> 29:30.140
A cat...

29:30.800 --> 29:31.490
Xuanye!

29:32.790 --> 29:33.480
Xuanye!

29:36.350 --> 29:37.000
What's up?

29:37.400 --> 29:38.960
I think I just saw the Cat Demon.

29:59.390 --> 30:00.780
[Xin]

30:09.720 --> 30:10.480
He's gone.

30:11.280 --> 30:12.240
He disappeared right after

30:12.270 --> 30:12.920
entering this courtyard.

30:15.410 --> 30:16.130
Could this be

30:16.150 --> 30:17.430
his lair?

30:18.550 --> 30:20.030
Since we reached the Reunion Inn,

30:20.790 --> 30:21.960
it seems like he's been trying to lead us

30:21.960 --> 30:22.720
to this place.

30:26.720 --> 30:27.620
Let's look for him.

30:37.920 --> 30:38.440
Who is it?

30:45.830 --> 30:46.510
Banxia?

30:47.400 --> 30:48.310
Yanqiu?

30:51.000 --> 30:52.240
What brought you here?

30:54.880 --> 30:56.470
We're here for some issues.

30:57.350 --> 30:58.240
Yanqiu,

30:58.240 --> 30:59.230
why would you come here?

30:59.480 --> 31:00.790
Haven't you gone back to Nanyang?

31:01.110 --> 31:02.440
I happened to pass by this place,

31:02.990 --> 31:04.230
and I found the scenery beautiful.

31:04.790 --> 31:06.540
I felt a bit tired,

31:06.960 --> 31:08.200
so I thought I should stay here for a rest.

31:08.830 --> 31:10.080
Does the family know about this?

31:10.590 --> 31:11.960
I already sent a letter.

31:14.160 --> 31:14.960
But, Yanqiu,

31:15.750 --> 31:16.970
do you know there's something wrong

31:17.000 --> 31:17.830
with this inn?

31:18.200 --> 31:19.680
It's not safe for you to stay here.

31:20.400 --> 31:21.270
What's wrong with this inn?

31:28.720 --> 31:29.480
I'm well aware of

31:29.510 --> 31:30.720
what Mr. Jiu is capable of.

31:31.310 --> 31:32.720
The innkeeper here is kind,

31:33.110 --> 31:34.000
and his employees work hard.

31:34.480 --> 31:35.790
I don't see anything wrong.

31:37.510 --> 31:39.030
I can't be a jinx

31:39.620 --> 31:42.340
who meets demons everywhere he goes, right?

31:44.870 --> 31:45.630
Lord Duan,

31:45.660 --> 31:46.790
maybe you're right.

31:47.350 --> 31:48.920
All we have now is just a theory.

31:50.440 --> 31:51.760
Lord Duan, have you not slept well

31:51.960 --> 31:53.070
in these days?

31:53.640 --> 31:55.190
I see dark circles under your eyes,

31:55.480 --> 31:56.390
and your lips are pale.

31:57.000 --> 31:59.030
Perhaps something is wrong with your blood circulation.

31:59.830 --> 32:01.650
I guess the high humidity here

32:01.920 --> 32:02.820
has affected your health.

32:03.300 --> 32:04.060
I'm fine.

32:04.660 --> 32:07.180
I just got disturbed

32:07.650 --> 32:08.780
by the humming insects outside.

32:12.860 --> 32:13.380
Banxia.

32:17.750 --> 32:19.390
Why don't you let me feel your pulse,

32:19.620 --> 32:20.140
so I can prescribe

32:20.170 --> 32:21.320
some calming and sleep-aiding medicine for you?

32:27.590 --> 32:28.910
Although I am a demon hunter now,

32:29.200 --> 32:30.440
I used to study medicine.

32:32.350 --> 32:32.960
What?

32:33.680 --> 32:34.750
Do you not trust me, Lord Duan?

32:35.880 --> 32:36.590
Why wouldn't I?

32:37.370 --> 32:38.130
It's just that...

32:38.640 --> 32:39.500
I know about

32:39.530 --> 32:40.470
my own health.

32:41.030 --> 32:41.960
There are no serious problems.

32:42.310 --> 32:44.720
I'd hate to bother you, Mr. Jiu.

32:45.070 --> 32:46.440
No worries. It's just a small favor.

32:52.290 --> 32:53.970
It's getting late.

32:54.830 --> 32:56.870
We'll pick up our talk tomorrow.

32:57.440 --> 32:59.000
You two should get some rest.

32:59.790 --> 33:00.480
Okay.

33:00.840 --> 33:02.310
Goodnight, Lord Duan.

33:03.150 --> 33:05.390
I'll take Banxia back to our room.

33:23.710 --> 33:25.310
My cousin was acting weird, don't you think?

33:26.920 --> 33:27.920
Yes, I think so.

33:29.240 --> 33:29.960
He was impatient

33:29.990 --> 33:31.020
about our conversation,

33:31.400 --> 33:33.370
and he refused any physical contact.

33:33.790 --> 33:34.960
Most importantly,

33:36.000 --> 33:37.120
he didn't seem to care about

33:37.140 --> 33:38.480
us, a man and a woman,

33:38.500 --> 33:39.350
being here alone.

33:39.990 --> 33:40.950
He didn't ask a single question

33:41.070 --> 33:42.340
when I took you away.

33:43.100 --> 33:44.710
He is different from his usual self.

33:46.400 --> 33:48.000
What do you think caused the change?

33:49.640 --> 33:50.550
I think

33:51.230 --> 33:52.420
he was hiding something.

33:54.220 --> 33:55.240
Hiding something?

33:56.550 --> 33:57.690
Did you smell

33:57.720 --> 33:58.750
alcohol on him just now?

34:03.550 --> 34:04.440
I did.

34:05.280 --> 34:06.390
The strong calming fragrance

34:06.420 --> 34:07.710
in the room

34:07.960 --> 34:09.000
covered that scent, though.

34:11.080 --> 34:12.199
But my cousin does

34:12.230 --> 34:13.800
have a habit of drinking alcohol.

34:15.670 --> 34:16.650
Don't worry.

34:17.110 --> 34:18.360
He's staying at this inn now.

34:18.670 --> 34:19.920
We'll look after him.

34:20.320 --> 34:21.040
For the time being,

34:21.070 --> 34:22.330
he is safe.

34:24.510 --> 34:25.320
Let's go back to our place.

34:26.670 --> 34:27.320
Okay.

34:33.000 --> 34:34.590
Still worried about your cousin, aren't you?

34:37.510 --> 34:39.360
I understand what you told me,

34:40.630 --> 34:42.360
but something still baffles me.

34:45.110 --> 34:46.190
My cousin has always

34:46.190 --> 34:47.150
respected rules

34:47.150 --> 34:48.190
and acted properly.

34:48.920 --> 34:50.070
I can't figure out why

34:50.070 --> 34:51.110
he would become like this.

34:52.760 --> 34:54.230
My father is missing.

34:54.710 --> 34:55.440
Although we're

34:55.440 --> 34:57.150
onto a clue about the Cat Demon now,

34:57.760 --> 34:58.760
we still don't know

34:58.760 --> 35:00.200
where exactly he has been taken.

35:01.280 --> 35:02.470
Now, even my cousin

35:02.490 --> 35:03.610
has been dragged into this.

35:05.520 --> 35:06.700
Why do things of this kind

35:06.730 --> 35:08.290
keep happening to my family?

35:09.260 --> 35:10.970
First, I became able to see demons.

35:11.920 --> 35:13.920
Then, I found out my cousin was in love with me.

35:14.880 --> 35:15.630
My father

35:15.630 --> 35:16.960
was even taken away by a demon.

35:19.590 --> 35:20.670
I can't stop thinking

35:21.590 --> 35:22.550
if these misfortunes

35:22.550 --> 35:24.190
befell us because of me

35:24.630 --> 35:25.670
and my eyes

35:25.690 --> 35:26.580
that can see demons.

35:27.130 --> 35:28.300
Maybe that's the reason

35:28.330 --> 35:29.890
that demons would try to hunt them down

35:29.920 --> 35:31.000
or bewitch them.

35:33.400 --> 35:34.190
Each of those incidents

35:34.190 --> 35:35.440
happened right in front of me,

35:36.280 --> 35:37.630
yet I couldn't do anything.

35:40.800 --> 35:42.230
You're doing a good enough job already.

35:43.000 --> 35:44.570
I remember when you first

35:45.050 --> 35:45.810
met Manniang

35:45.840 --> 35:46.920
and Chi Wangchuan,

35:47.190 --> 35:48.150
you were so panicked.

35:48.510 --> 35:49.510
But now, you can

35:49.510 --> 35:50.510
calmly face everything.

35:51.390 --> 35:52.220
For example,

35:52.760 --> 35:53.950
when the Cat Demon suddenly appeared today,

35:54.400 --> 35:55.920
you went after him without hesitation.

35:56.440 --> 35:57.520
You didn't chicken out.

35:57.710 --> 35:59.150
No one could've done

35:59.880 --> 36:01.400
better than you.

36:03.510 --> 36:04.190
Banxia,

36:05.190 --> 36:06.480
you're very brave.

36:09.510 --> 36:11.590
But if I had been braver

36:13.190 --> 36:14.360
and more careful,

36:16.280 --> 36:18.030
maybe I could've noticed

36:18.030 --> 36:19.400
that my father was off that day, right?

36:20.510 --> 36:22.430
If I had known Chi Wangchuan was in his room,

36:22.630 --> 36:24.120
none of these things could've happened.

36:25.220 --> 36:26.550
We are just ordinary people.

36:26.950 --> 36:28.100
We can't foresee the future.

36:28.620 --> 36:30.390
You shouldn't beat yourself up

36:30.480 --> 36:32.550
for what you did.

36:33.330 --> 36:34.370
You didn't do anything wrong.

36:41.190 --> 36:42.360
Under these circumstances,

36:42.670 --> 36:44.840
you must have a strong will.

36:46.110 --> 36:46.920
Don't be sad.

36:47.670 --> 36:49.010
I'm not sad.

36:49.030 --> 36:50.620
Something got into my eye.

36:51.590 --> 36:52.360
Really?

36:53.480 --> 36:54.190
Let me see.

36:55.600 --> 36:56.330
Where?

36:56.440 --> 36:57.080
The right eye.

36:57.110 --> 36:57.760
The right eye.

36:58.630 --> 36:59.520
This one?

37:14.320 --> 37:15.000
Are you feeling better?

37:21.190 --> 37:22.620
If something gets into your eyes again,

37:22.760 --> 37:24.030
wash them with clean water first,

37:24.320 --> 37:25.550
or ask someone for help.

37:25.840 --> 37:27.150
You can't rub them with your hands.

37:27.480 --> 37:28.670
Or your eyes could get hurt.

37:30.190 --> 37:31.320
I got it, Physician Jiu.

37:35.280 --> 37:36.070
A laugh. Seriously?

37:37.230 --> 37:38.070
Do you remember what I said?

37:39.230 --> 37:40.000
I do.

37:42.100 --> 37:43.540
But that can't stop me from laughing.

37:50.960 --> 37:52.000
Is Banxia asleep?

37:53.670 --> 37:54.360
Yes.

37:55.480 --> 37:56.550
Where have you been?

37:57.590 --> 37:58.590
I was out trying to catch the Cat Demon.

37:59.110 --> 38:00.760
I meant to ambush it in a narrow lane.

38:01.340 --> 38:02.450
But I got lost

38:02.480 --> 38:03.230
in this large place.

38:05.190 --> 38:06.190
Come on, lad.

38:11.030 --> 38:11.630
What?

38:12.440 --> 38:13.150
I'm curious.

38:14.320 --> 38:15.760
Did you just kiss Banxia?

38:17.030 --> 38:18.230
Who would kiss her?

38:19.480 --> 38:20.190
Give me an answer,

38:20.800 --> 38:21.840
or I won't let you sleep.

38:22.710 --> 38:23.590
Don't talk nonsense.

38:24.230 --> 38:25.440
I clearly saw it.

38:26.280 --> 38:27.280
You were sitting there with her.

38:28.000 --> 38:28.630
And then...

38:35.000 --> 38:36.190
When we were sitting there,

38:36.210 --> 38:37.120
sand grains got into

38:37.150 --> 38:37.840
her right eye,

38:37.860 --> 38:39.010
so I gave her a little help.

38:39.520 --> 38:40.790
Don't try to fool me.

38:41.170 --> 38:42.140
I have

38:42.390 --> 38:43.870
seen through you.

38:45.110 --> 38:45.880
Is that so?

38:46.800 --> 38:47.590
Tell me about it.

38:47.830 --> 38:48.580
I'm all ears.

38:52.510 --> 38:53.320
I can't describe it,

38:54.270 --> 38:54.810
but I'm sure

38:54.840 --> 38:56.070
the way you look at Banxia

38:57.070 --> 38:58.360
is just the same as the way

38:58.670 --> 38:59.400
your dad looked at your mom,

38:59.400 --> 39:00.920
and the way your brother looked at Miss Wang.

39:05.120 --> 39:06.900
[Reunion Inn]

39:10.400 --> 39:11.000
Sir,

39:11.670 --> 39:12.710
there are rats in our room.

39:13.030 --> 39:13.590
Rats?

39:13.630 --> 39:14.280
Yeah.

39:14.710 --> 39:16.000
Why would there be rats?

39:16.020 --> 39:16.880
It's true.

39:17.080 --> 39:17.850
They made so much noise last night.

39:17.880 --> 39:18.630
I didn't sleep well.

39:18.650 --> 39:19.520
Please come and take a look.

39:58.630 --> 39:59.550
Stop it.

40:00.600 --> 40:01.290
Dismissed.

40:04.230 --> 40:05.110
Banxia.

40:08.000 --> 40:09.550
What were you doing?

40:10.110 --> 40:10.880
Dancing?

40:11.960 --> 40:12.920
We were

40:13.480 --> 40:14.550
just playing in our spare time.

40:15.840 --> 40:18.440
You look great today.

40:19.550 --> 40:20.550
The mountain is very quiet.

40:20.640 --> 40:21.550
I got some good rest.

40:24.510 --> 40:27.280
I heard something big happened

40:27.510 --> 40:28.850
in Jia Court last night.

40:29.430 --> 40:31.240
Did that disturb you?

40:32.710 --> 40:33.630
You already heard about it?

40:36.900 --> 40:38.130
It was just a wild cat.

40:39.450 --> 40:40.960
I brought some snacks from Guangping.

40:40.980 --> 40:42.240
Not much is left. Try some.

40:45.070 --> 40:46.070
Banxia, have you forgotten

40:46.440 --> 40:48.730
that my sense of taste doesn't work?

40:50.900 --> 40:52.130
Even so,

40:52.760 --> 40:54.900
you still need food.

40:57.190 --> 40:58.740
These snacks look good.

40:59.440 --> 41:00.440
I'll bring them back

41:00.460 --> 41:02.210
and eat with my father.

41:04.230 --> 41:04.920
Wuniang,

41:06.550 --> 41:07.870
I want to ask you something.

41:08.350 --> 41:09.260
You told me

41:09.290 --> 41:10.860
that we were the only guests here

41:10.960 --> 41:12.360
since the inn was being renovated.

41:14.030 --> 41:15.520
But yesterday, I saw someone staying

41:15.590 --> 41:16.510
in Xin Court.

41:16.880 --> 41:17.670
Really?

41:22.440 --> 41:22.960
Oh, right.

41:23.880 --> 41:25.070
A guest is staying there.

41:25.920 --> 41:28.320
He is a young gentleman.

41:29.440 --> 41:31.440
Since he came to our inn,

41:31.880 --> 41:33.200
he has never left his room.

41:34.330 --> 41:35.890
I haven't seen him much,

41:36.650 --> 41:37.610
so I just

41:40.000 --> 41:41.040
forgot about him.

41:42.360 --> 41:43.110
Forgot?

41:43.820 --> 41:46.180
Some guests are odd.

41:46.910 --> 41:48.030
They don't want to

41:48.550 --> 41:50.280
stay at home

41:50.530 --> 41:51.970
for certain reasons.

41:52.630 --> 41:53.920
They would choose to come

41:54.400 --> 41:56.320
to this remote mountain instead.

41:57.880 --> 41:58.480
I don't know

41:58.480 --> 42:00.150
what they are hiding from.

42:02.400 --> 42:03.030
Banxia,

42:03.550 --> 42:05.280
why did you suddenly ask about him?

42:06.030 --> 42:07.070
Do you know him?

42:09.030 --> 42:10.230
He is my cousin.

42:12.670 --> 42:13.400
Really?

42:15.440 --> 42:16.870
But you two don't

42:16.900 --> 42:18.200
look alike at all.

42:19.920 --> 42:22.390
You are better-looking.

42:25.720 --> 42:27.190
You're so blessed, Banxia.

42:28.510 --> 42:29.550
You have a husband

42:30.360 --> 42:31.360
and a cousin.

42:31.860 --> 42:32.800
By contrast,

42:33.910 --> 42:35.310
all I have is my father.

42:36.360 --> 42:38.280
My brother has been gone for a long time.

42:39.670 --> 42:41.000
You have a brother?

42:44.400 --> 42:45.800
He ran away.

42:47.960 --> 42:48.800
Someday,

42:49.750 --> 42:51.180
I'll run away too.

42:53.360 --> 42:53.840
Banxia,

42:54.550 --> 42:56.500
can I go to your home

42:57.000 --> 42:57.510
when that happens?
